  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency life-saving Health, Nutrition, WASH and Protection support for vulnerable populations affected by adverse effects of El Nino in South Central Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In anticipation of El-Nino, Caafimaad consortium is preparing an integrated response (health, nutrition, WASH, and protection) that will layer services in existing facilities, existing communties, as well as new settlements that are identified as high risk locations</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase access to a package of integrated life-saving emergency health services. Increase access to preventive and curative nutrition services. Improve access to safe water, sanitation and waste management. Increase access to protection service, especially targeting women and children in the affected districts. Outbreak response.</narrative>
  </description>
